{"ID":"20240205153722-x8322b0","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153722-x8322b0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153722-x8322b0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095821-1jn4vl0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162417-hj04l2s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095821-1jn4vl0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:134,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:134\u0026#125;","title":"鹤虱","type":"doc","updated":"20240903093646"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095821-1jn4vl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095821-1jn4vl0","updated":"20240206095829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产陕西、甘肃、山西、河南等地。\n【性状】\t呈圆柱状，细小，长3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4mm，直径不及1mm。表面黄褐色或暗褐色，具多数纵棱。一端收缩呈细喙叶，先端扩展成灰白色圆环；另端稍尖，有着生痕迹。果皮薄，纤维性，种皮菲薄透明，子叶2，类白色，稍有油性。气特异，味微苦。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，平，有小毒。\n【功效】\t杀虫，清热解毒，健脾和胃。治虫积腹痛，阴道滴虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095822-1wwvzpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095822-1wwvzpd","updated":"20240206095822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095822-spzzgep.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731090753-2cr9d87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731090753-2cr9d87","updated":"20240731090753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天名精"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天名精-20240619135159-pa9d8cq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 358px;\" parent-style=\"width: 368px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 720px;","style":"width: 710px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天名精2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天名精2-20240619135218-j9cyfku.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 710px;\" parent-style=\"width: 720px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731090753-e34je4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731090753-e34je4z","updated":"20240903093558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 835px;","style":"width: 825px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天名精3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天名精3-20240619135523-0wzc68a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 825px;\" parent-style=\"width: 835px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 421px;","style":"width: 411px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天名精 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天名精 10-20240807132109-gyt3ppa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 411px;\" parent-style=\"width: 421px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731090753-wo3wsey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731090753-wo3wsey","updated":"20240731090753"},"Children":[{"